  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medication and Medical Equipment supply to hospitals in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Needs for medicines and medical supplies are expressed and shared in an exchange of information between health care providers in Ukraine (MD or health facility) and the Project Health Care Support based in Ukraine and/or members of Artsenhulp&#x2019;s Contact Group (Doctors in the Netherlands and Poland - Ukrainian-speaking). Needs might also originate from the SV health care project. The main purpose is to provide direct support to health facilities, medical staff, NGOs and physicians in Ukraine with medication and medical equipment. As other international actors also support health care facilities in Ukraine, the focus is on identifying acute medical gaps in the supply lines and on providing a fast response by supplying medication and medical equipment until other actors can step in.</narrative>
  </description>
